  "description": {
    "text": "From 23 May to 12 June 2014, each Pokémon XY Happy Meal at McDonald's in the United States held one of these 12 cards, each with a McDonald's M stamp on its picture, and one of 12 battle launcher toys, of classic Pokémon such as Pikachu and Mewtwo or of Pokémon from Pokémon X and Y such as Chespin, Fennekin, Froakie, Xerneas and Yveltal. France had the promotion first, from 2 April 2014, and other major markets followed later in the year.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "PocketMonsters.net: Pokémon Happy Meals Coming Soon to McDonald's Locations in the US (the 2014 press release)",
        "url": "https://pocketmonsters.net/news/1828"
      },
      {
        "title": "Pokumon: Pikachu (5/12, McDonald's 2014)",
        "url": "https://pokumon.com/card/pikachu-5-12-mcdonalds-mcdonalds-collection-2/"
      }
    ]
  },
